{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "37e2ace10abf98299525949e19491d2b2f9df6a1622e92bc2d34d77c064f8b47", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんっ！\nよかった、ちょうど日焼け止めを探して……て？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n太好了，我正好在找防晒乳……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "731d0841c6ea860c2ef9453132d7cd2b1a1a98787e292ddb2385744f840dbaa3", "ja": "ふえやぁっ！　間違えました、ごめんなさい！\n{$P$}さんを探してたんですっ！", "zh": "哎呀！我搞错了，对不起！\n我正在找{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "30485693323decff3f9c1555df170cd5889129a97f7543e4dd34b99bbdf0c569", "ja": "そ、そうですか。\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "是、是吗？\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "d30f1b7497edec74a01aa34179590696822b57e9f05488ae9aa603e8cdf9f4b3", "ja": "はい！　社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんを呼んでるんです。", "zh": "是的！社长他要找\n{$P$}先生过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "80b9deb93d929b322f5f3da58cf683823bfa326ef02f49242355e9036fb92f78", "ja": "何でも、大切なお話があるんだとか。", "zh": "似乎是有很重要的事要说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d1044d37224a1da55374924fa266995e22f47aef8c10de6d6bebe881acb891ca", "ja": "大切な話……何だろう。\nとにかく、社長に話を聞きに行ってきます。", "zh": "重要的事……是什么呢？\n总之我先去听社长要说的事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "af89d9e3627f60c674a9893053913c87e3a52c712c6440841651be73871fe2d1", "ja": "よろしくお願いしますね！\nいってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "就麻烦你了喔！\n路上小心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4b48687ae03cafada0f606436bfe7128cb483b79a00b6e23e8cd199bf1bc04b3", "ja": "社長、音無さん、おはようございます。\nあれ？　音無さん、どうして落ちこんでるんですか？", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，早安。\n奇怪？音无小姐，你怎么这么沮丧呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "d673346bff5dc2e1573ee8694656d44051b7256ce9b8998d59e203a221f2cc8d", "ja": "うう、実は……。さっき、1日かけて作ったデータを、\nうっかり消してしまいまして……。", "zh": "呜呜，其实……我刚才一不小心，\n就把花了一整天才做好的资料给删掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "668c907ffdc8098c3ec08f182901550be4e5feac46e5297add3963cf9043c270", "ja": "そ、そうですか、災難でしたね……。\n俺に手伝えることがあったら、言ってください。", "zh": "这、这样啊，真是飞来横祸……\n如果有什么帮得上忙的地方，就请告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "b05ee042038e39c307b7a4f3124e5962b6539234a1c2895bdadd3464da50b299", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます……\nううっ、{$P$}さんお優しい……。", "zh": "好的，谢谢你……\n呜呜，{$P$}先生人真好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b67ae71d4e0eaa40b4dad547dcccea84853f7c02b2143bcbb71d26383f090a92", "ja": "それはそうと、社長。\n大切な話というのは……。", "zh": "先不说这个了，社长，\n那个重要的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "5c238849098c989b0a4748c4f355a9cdf9122ed8e10509690f2f3fdc440b1617", "ja": "うむ！　先日は、『クレシェンドブルー』の\nプロデュース、ご苦労だったね。", "zh": "嗯！之前『Crescendo Blue』的培育，\n真是辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "54ed3d0faeb0a9e54061e42fa99ce5cef4e952cdf6086ea85ba08d75dbb4f7ac", "ja": "おかげで、公演は大成功だった！　君にはやはり、\nプロデューサーとしての才能があるようだ。", "zh": "多亏有你，公演非常成功呢！\n看来你果然很有当制作人的才华。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "1b50937cfc3394916ac84505dd5261f1bd0bcf3734f9901c1d75a675d5706ef5", "ja": "アイドル達と真摯に向き合う、\nその気持ちを、これからも忘れないでほしい。", "zh": "希望你未来也不要忘记\n与偶像们真诚相待的那份心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "1e35d46e5178dd99f6b260627c70f925a869811bc0c57098a2ee02deff953c6c", "ja": "君を見ていると、若いころの私を思い出すよ。\nそう、あれは、数十年前のことだ……。", "zh": "看着你，就想起年轻时的我呢。\n没错，那是几十年前的事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "4c27aa6c6dc8f9c74c720a09fe4e11d7618ebc028339299a72223de93fcd78df", "ja": "あの、社長？　できれば、そろそろ\n本題に入って頂いた方が……時間もありますし。", "zh": "那个，社长？可以的话，\n差不多该进入正题了……毕竟时间有限。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "b4f737004aefcec85aa2947c9306c7dbacf60dbe7980bc360b490ecd326062c8", "ja": "おっと、そうだったね。おっほん。\n今日、君を呼んだのは他でもない。", "zh": "唉呀，说得也是呢。咳咳，\n今天叫你过来不为别的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "f5acd83a16a5a3c4ee8e4fc727f306fa54e64551f6a0361ed7abf4397924d3f9", "ja": "実は君に、新しいユニットを\n担当してほしいと考えているのだよ！", "zh": "其实啊，我想让你来负责\n新的团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "d37580b66e7028e9db469908fa6ce78998db37a79b98e4bec9a9f47eb52c511b", "ja": "その名も、『乙女ストーム！』だ！", "zh": "团名便是『少女风暴！』喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c8b728ea16036bc841911049311542aaaaf2ed91c04bb1f04a40fbf1b1f1b5c6", "ja": "『乙女ストーム！』……！", "zh": "『少女风暴！』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "1eeff4c214535bd8fc6f8b9ea81e3293913a7a31fb0b2056ba7724153453352b", "ja": "メンバーは、七尾百合子君、伊吹翼君、\n望月杏奈君、真壁瑞希君。", "zh": "成员有七尾百合子、伊吹翼、\n望月杏奈、真壁瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "4aa0111445770514a94fdb86fb7d1f24a9c93f1185c0ca9a2ef3d86616143f10", "ja": "そしてリーダーは、春日未来君だ！\nどうだね、引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "而队长则是春日未来！\n怎么样？你愿意接下这个任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a9734f62b313e6370493610c4371b9dd640555c64b53dd1dbca43eaf2d6e9bd8", "ja": "もちろんです！\n……それにしても、独特なユニット名ですね。", "zh": "当然！\n……不过这团体名还真是特别呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "ca54724aa962419ff620585d14224bb77f0c3842b9daac8210142d58fe1e0df9", "ja": "ああ。覚えやすいだろう？\n我ながら、このネーミングには手応えを感じているよ。", "zh": "是啊，很好记吧？\n连我自己都觉得这名字取得很好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "ba52ac01f301ec2937d0f781d8102944381f02641f268896306add207edb1245", "ja": "劇場に嵐を巻き起こしてほしい、\nという思いを込めてつけたユニット名だ。", "zh": "这个团体名称带着\n「希望她们在剧场中刮起风暴」的意涵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "daaae49f0f3cff26dacfe9dc2d172a4fa7fc09954647eef0cf200a5646e6fe95", "ja": "君達なら、必ずや、素晴らしい公演にできるはずだ！\n期待しているよ！", "zh": "你们一定可以完成一场精彩万分的公演！\n我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f40d886bdf8c948aff604b9882e7208bf8d1339b053eaaea72dc99f6072dbecb", "ja": "はい！　任せてください！", "zh": "是的！请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a2149988fab3da92ed3bb99c14687d6e923de34c1c9e9597280512ddf3fe21c9", "ja": "それじゃ、俺はこれから劇場に戻って、\nメンバーにユニット結成について知らせてきます。", "zh": "那我接下来就回到剧场，\n告知成员们团体成军的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d31ff3fe055cb4551839515f2fef61e45a15b4cf49a3dbc895499be1a3c5adfe", "ja": "じゃあ、行きますけど……。\nあの、音無さん、頑張ってください……。", "zh": "那我就先走了……\n那个，音无小姐，请你加油了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "02426c106614390137f12d15ac866eabbe7cd297c71409c0358369b31a8ada2c", "ja": "ううっ、ありがとうございます……。\n{$P$}さんも、頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "呜呜，谢谢你……\n{$P$}先生也请加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "190e03171f3aaa390e68e094dda3db8d0512ebeeeca87683621929ad1d4c8c01", "ja": "（『乙女ストーム！』か。\nずいぶんと個性的なメンバーが集まったユニットだな）", "zh": "（『少女风暴！』啊，\n这团体真是聚集了相当有个性的成员呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "56f3c84407906d3a9a7c3027f2d29bc7d6ad479b1b2a0dd08e38eccfa301747a", "ja": "（ユニットという名の、輝きの競演。\n新たなプラチナスターシアターの開演だ！）", "zh": "（以团体为名的闪耀竞演，\n崭新的白金星光剧场即将开演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
